				Time="2011-07-18T06:06:49" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:19:53" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
